We had the same problem and solved it in the following way:

1. Create a directory /usr/dxt and move the dxterm executable to there.
2. Replace /usr/bin/dxterm by the following csh script:
	#! /bin/csh
	exec /usr/dxt/dxterm $*

This was found by trial and error, could someone please explain WHY it
works?
