The way I understood is that it (the DEQNA) will only work with DECNet
Phase IV routing - when Phase V is finally fully available, the DEQNA
will NOT be able to handle the load.

HOWEVER - you WILL be able to run Phase IV within a Phase V network.  So
if you never upgrade past VMS 5.4-3, you'll be ok.

