I've had an LNO3 connected up to my XT clone before.  I was just using
its serial port at 9600.  The XT was set up to do something like
  mode com1:9600,n,8,1
  mode lpt1:=com1:
or something to redirect lpt1 to the com1 port.  Check your manuals for
the exact syntax of the mode command.  I only used it for text printing, 
and as I remember, I would get a "6" error on the printer when I printed, 
and would take it offline and back online again and it would print ok.
Drivers?  Who knows?

