I, too, hope DEC loses these suits for their own sake.  It seems like market
suicide.  They may sell a few more drives for the short term, but they'll sell
far fewer systems when those folks upgrade.  I really like DEC products, but
their marketing department has always been counter-productive.  They also need
to get their legal staff on a leash, and stop nipping at the heels of anyone
that wants to do business that complements their systems but competes with
their peripherals.  I don't know why they bother, since they seem to migrating
